    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Estate Agents are proud to present No.25 Tandy's Place, a stunning 3 bedroom/3 bathroom home which measures a substanial 108 sq.m. This is a wonderfully situated property in a very quiet enclave and benefits from a wonderful southwest facing rear garden.\n\nRated A for energy efficiency, the property boasts a range of modern features, including Air to Water heating, panelled walls, colonial shutters and is decorated with an abundance of good taste with an interior designer's eye. This property will be sold inclusive of integrated kitchen appliances and provides a turnkey opportunity for the discenring purchaser.\n\nOffering light-filled and airy space throughout due to its sunny orientation, accommodation comprises an entrance hallway with guest bathroom, living room, an open-plan kitchen/dining room with a complementing utility room all on the ground floor level. \n\nOn the first floor there are three generously proportioned bedrooms (master en-suite) and a main family bathroom. \nThe layout and interior finish will have broad appeal to those busy families looking for a turn-key home in this sought after and convenient location within Adamstown.\n\nExternally, the property features a landscaped rear garden, which is sun drenched most of the day due to its south west orientation.To the front, there is a paved driveway offering off-street parking for two cars.\n\nTandy's Place is an exclusive residential development, ideally located just off the Newcastle Road, just minutes from Lucan Village with its host of eateries, pubs and shops. Readily accessible to the N4/M4/N7/M7/M50 transport links are excellent. Both bus and rail facilities are within easy reach linking commuters to Dublin City centre and beyond. The Crossings shopping centre with Tesco and Aldi is closeby, as too are the Schools, Adamstown Community College, St. John the Evangelist National School & Adamstown Castle Educate Together. \n\nThe surrounding area has much for the outdoor enthusiast to enjoy with plenty of activity in Tandy's Lane Park to include, walks, children's playgrounds, sports pitches, tennis courts, cricket ground, adult exercise equipment, teenagers area with parkour equipment, seating and picnic benches and Cafe.\n\nTo secure an appointment to view please call Audrey Higgins on 01 6280400"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.97m x 4.66m\nWelcoming entrance hallway with Herringbone wood flooring, bespoke under stair storage units, storage cupboard and alarm panel\n\nWC - 1.95m x 1.49m\nFully tiled guest wc with a wc and whb\n\nLiving Room - 3.78m x 4.2m\nSpaciious living room to the front with Herringbone wood flooring, tv point and double doors opening to the kitchen/dining\n\nKitchen/Dining - 3.78m x 4.9m\nLight filled kitchen/dining to the rear with a fully fitted kitchen sold inclusive of the oven/hob, fridge/freezer and dishwasher. With Quartz counter tops and Herringbone wood flooring.\n\nUtility Room - 1.92m x 2.04m\nWith fitted cabinets, tiled flooring, plumbing for washing machine and access to the garden\n\nLanding - 2.26m x 4.42m\nWith Stira stairs to the attic space, wood flooring and hot linen press\n\nEnsuite - 1.38m x 2.44m\nTiled ensuite shower room with a shower, wc and whb\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.38m x 3.84m\nSpacious master bedroom to the front with an ensuite shower room, built in wardrobes and wood flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.94m x 3.77m\nLarge double bedroom to the rear with wood flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.74m x 2.61m\nSingle bedroom to the rear with wood flooring\n\nBathroom - 2.3m x 1.98m\nFully tiled bathroom with a bath, wc and whb\n\nFront Garden - \nWith mature planting, paved parking space\n\nRear Garden - \nSun drenched rear garden with a south west orientation ensuring the home is bathed in natural light. Patio and lawn areas with raised flower beds\n\n"
      },
      {
